---
---

<section id="verify" class="verify">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="verify-grid">
      <div class="verify-text">
        <span class="section-tag">Verification</span>
        <h2>Don't trust. Verify.</h2>
        <p>
          Traditional AI asks you to trust the operator. Determinisma Komputado
          asks you to verify the math. Every output comes with a compact proof
          that an independent party can check — no GPU farm, no model weights,
          no trust required.
        </p>
        <ul class="checklist">
          <li><span class="check">✓</span> Tamper-evident Merkle traces</li>
          <li><span class="check">✓</span> Sub-linear verification of full computations</li>
          <li><span class="check">✓</span> Open, auditable verification protocol</li>
          <li><span class="check">✓</span> Works with any deterministic model architecture</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="verify-visual">
        <div class="proof-card">
          <div class="proof-header">
            <span class="proof-title">Verification Proof</span>
            <span class="proof-status">VALID</span>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-row">
            <span class="proof-key">Input hash</span>
            <span class="proof-val">7f3a…c2e1</span>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-row">
            <span class="proof-key">Output hash</span>
            <span class="proof-val">a3f7…2e1d</span>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-row">
            <span class="proof-key">Trace root</span>
            <span class="proof-val">b8d4…9f0a</span>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-row">
            <span class="proof-key">Steps verified</span>
            <span class="proof-val">1,284,506</span>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-bar">
            <div class="proof-bar-fill"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="proof-footer">All 1,284,506 steps match committed trace</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .verify {
    padding: 80px 0;
  }
  .verify-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 56px;
    align-items: center;
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .verify-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 40px; }
  }
  .section-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .verify-text h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .verify-text p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .checklist {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .checklist li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    color: var(--text);
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }
  .check {
    color: var(--green);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .proof-card {
    background: #060912;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
  }
  .proof-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .proof-title {
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .proof-status {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    padding: 4px 10px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    background: rgba(63, 214, 138, 0.15);
    color: var(--green);
    border: 1px solid rgba(63, 214, 138, 0.3);
  }
  .proof-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 10px 0;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(35, 44, 71, 0.5);
  }
  .proof-key { color: var(--text-dim); }
  .proof-val {
    font-family: "SF Mono", "Fira Code", monospace;
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .proof-bar {
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--border);
    border-radius: 3px;
    margin: 20px 0 10px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .proof-bar-fill {
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--accent), var(--green));
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .proof-footer {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--green);
    text-align: center;
  }
</style>
